course: dictionary
lesson: 6566
title: Nicotine: the hidden hook
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Nicotine is a chemical drug. You can use context to work out what it means. «Nicotine, found in cigarettes and vapes, is one of these hooks» tells you it is something inside those products, and that it grabs you like a hook does.
explain: «Nicotine is very addictive, so smokers feel uncomfortable until they have the next one» shows what it does. Addictive means it makes people want more and find it very hard to stop. The word uncomfortable is a clue: the body feels bad without it.
explain: «Liquid nicotine in e-cigarette refills is poisonous even in small amounts.» Poisonous is the clue that it is harmful. That is why liquid nicotine must be kept away from small children and pets.
fact: Nicotine is a chemical drug found in tobacco plants.
fact: Nicotine is found in cigarettes and vapes.
fact: Nicotine is poisonous, and it makes people addicted, so they find it very hard to stop.
fact: It is illegal to sell cigarettes and nicotine vapes to children.
fact: Liquid nicotine for vapes is poisonous if swallowed, so keep it away from small children and pets.
exercise: «Nicotine is very addictive, so smokers feel uncomfortable until they have the next one.» What does addictive mean? | Makes people laugh a lot | *Makes people want more and find it very hard to stop | Makes people very tired and sleepy | Makes people very rich
exercise: «Liquid nicotine in e-cigarette refills is poisonous even in small amounts.» What does poisonous mean? | Sweet and tasty | Cool and fresh | *Harmful, and dangerous to swallow | Good for the lungs
exercise: «Nicotine, found in cigarettes and vapes, is one of these hooks.» Where does the sentence say nicotine is found? | *Cigarettes and vapes | Sandwiches and drinks | Toys and games | Sweets and crisps
test: «Fags» is British slang for what? | Sweets | Sandwiches | Football boots | *Cigarettes
test: What is nicotine? | A type of sweet | *A chemical drug found in tobacco, cigarettes and vapes | A sort of sport | A kind of plant food
exam: Which statement is true? | *It is illegal to sell nicotine vapes to children | It is legal to sell nicotine vapes to children | Nicotine is good for your heart | Liquid nicotine is safe to swallow
